# ==============================================================================
# 20_annular_inspection_scan.scara - Multi-Level Concentric Annular Inspection
# ==============================================================================
# Demonstrates 4-DOF inspection routines navigating the annular workspace bounds:
#
# 1. Inner Annular Scan (R = 140 mm):
#    - Scans concentric seam via circular arc interpolation (ARC_CCW / ARC_CW).
#    - Maintains safe radial distance from central base dead zone (R_min = 77.6 mm).
# 2. Outer Annular Perimeter Scan (R = 250 mm):
#    - Transits to outer reach and scans 90-degree quadrant arc.
#    - Respects outer singularity margin (safe limit R_safe = 295.0 mm).
# 3. Executes sensor trigger dwell pauses (WAIT_MS) and returns to safe standby.
# ==============================================================================

ENABLE
HOME

SPEED RAPID 120.0
SPEED WORK 40.0

# ----------------------------------------------------
# 1. Inner Annular Seam Inspection (Radius R=140 mm)
# ----------------------------------------------------
MOVE_L X=140.0 Y=0.0 Z=30.0 PHI=0.0
MOVE_L X=140.0 Y=0.0 Z=15.0 PHI=0.0

# Circular arc scan (arc around origin from (140, 0) to (99, 99))
ARC_CCW X=99.0 Y=99.0 I=-140.0 J=0.0 SPEED=30.0
WAIT_MS 60

# Reverse arc back to baseline
ARC_CW X=140.0 Y=0.0 I=-99.0 J=-99.0 SPEED=30.0
MOVE_L X=140.0 Y=0.0 Z=35.0 PHI=0.0

# ----------------------------------------------------
# 2. Outer Annular Perimeter Scan (Radius R=250 mm)
# ----------------------------------------------------
# Transit to outer perimeter (well within safe limit R_safe=295 mm)
MOVE_L X=250.0 Y=0.0 Z=35.0 PHI=0.0 SPEED=80.0
MOVE_L X=250.0 Y=0.0 Z=20.0 PHI=0.0 SPEED=35.0

# Counter-clockwise arc scan around origin from (250, 0) to (176.8, 176.8)
ARC_CCW X=176.8 Y=176.8 I=-250.0 J=0.0 SPEED=35.0
WAIT_MS 80

# Return arc back to baseline
ARC_CW X=250.0 Y=0.0 I=-176.8 J=-176.8 SPEED=35.0

# ----------------------------------------------------
# 3. Retract & Standby Parking
# ----------------------------------------------------
MOVE_L X=250.0 Y=0.0 Z=35.0 PHI=0.0 SPEED=80.0
MOVE_L X=150.0 Y=0.0 Z=25.0 PHI=0.0 SPEED=80.0
